---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service &amp; Disclaimer — Cosmetiqly"
  description="Terms of service, medical disclaimer, and acceptable use policies for Cosmetiqly ingredient evaluations."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-slate-900">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Terms</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Effective Date: November 13, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Educational Nature of Service</h2>
        <p>
          Cosmetiqly is an automated informational service that matches publicly declared cosmetic ingredient lists against published dermatological and toxicological reference lists. Use of this website is for educational and research purposes only.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/40">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-1">2. Medical &amp; Clinical Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-amber-900 leading-relaxed">
          The content on this website does not substitute for clinical medical evaluation, professional allergy testing, or dermatological prescription. Chemical tolerances vary widely between individuals. Always consult a qualified medical professional for skin disorders.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Open Database Licence (ODbL) Attribution</h2>
        <p>
          Product ingredient lists are derived from the Open Beauty Facts database, made available under the Open Database Licence (ODbL). Any database derivatives published by Cosmetiqly are provided in accordance with ODbL share-alike provisions.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
